identifier: kgmicrobe.ingredient:bd_228950_gc_agar_base
preferred_term: GC Medium Base (BD228950)
ontology_mapping:
  ontology_id: kgmicrobe.ingredient:bd_228950_gc_agar_base
  ontology_label: GC Medium Base (BD228950)
  ontology_source: kgmicrobe.ingredient
  mapping_quality: FALLBACK_REGISTRY
  evidence:
  - evidence_type: LLM_SUGGESTION
    source: https://imgcdn.mckesson.com/CumulusWeb/Click_and_learn/SDS_BBL_MEDIA_AGAR_GC_MED_BASE_500G.pdf
    notes: BD-authored SDS identifies catalog228950 as Chocolate Agar Base (GC Medium),
      manufacturer BD Diagnostic Systems, solid powder. TOGO M2206 paragraph11 explicitly
      lists six dry-base ingredients totaling36g; paragraph9 dissolves that base in500mL
      water, while paragraph13 separately prepares500mL water with10g dried bovine
      hemoglobin. IsoVitaleX is also a separate addition. The components below are
      only the six named dry-base inputs, with literal source-batch masses. No preparation
      water, hemoglobin or IsoVitaleX belongs to this dry product. Neither inspected
      source establishes the Difco sub-brand.
